WEBVTT

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:21.450
<b>Muhyo & Roji's
Bureau of Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.490
Nanagase Onsen-mae. Nanagase Onsen-mae.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.980
<b>Nanagase Onsen-mae</b>

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.540
Hot springs! Hot springs! Yippie yippie yay!

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:44.320
This is a business trip. Why is she here?

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.000
Well... the more the merrier, right?

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.080
<b>Nanagase Inn</b>

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:54.090
I-Is this...

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:00.110
<b>Article 6 
The Butterfly 
of the Night</b>

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.010
Yontani-sama?

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:05.470
Oh, yes. Sensei is out front right now.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.720
Are you Sensei's fans?

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.610
No, actually, we were asked 
to do a job for him...

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.670
Thank goodness the people here are normal.

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:18.160
Well, how about a dip in the 
hot springs while you wait?

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:19.650
Yes!

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.490
You...

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.490
came here just for this, didn't you?

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:35.550
Doesn't this feel great, Muhyo?

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.400
I'm so glad we're here.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:39.930
How's the water on your side?

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:44.030
It's absolutely perfect.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:49.690
Yes, she may indeed be absolutely perfect.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.650
How old is she, I wonder?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.790
From the youthful glow of 
her skin, I'd say mid-teens.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:03:00.520
The incomplete clavicle suggests she's 
far from reaching maturity as a woman,

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:03.830
but those developed breasts 
are quite captivating.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:06.080
I know, right?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.580
My shoulders have been so stiff lately...

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:09.830
Wait.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.530
What's the idea?!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.070
You peeping tom!

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:26.310
Nana-chan, now's your chance to...

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.390
Roji-kun, you pervert!

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.230
No, I—

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:36.030
Peeping? Certainly not!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.750
That was mere observation!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.760
Untie me at once, you insolent fools!

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.760
This peeping geezer is Sensei.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:41.950
Huh?!

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:48.450
So you're the magical law 
officials I sent for!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.490
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.590
I'm Yontani Abeyuki, the author.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.590
My magnum opus is...

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:57.200
<b>Magnum Opus</b>

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.210
<i>Within Love</i>.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.200
<b>"Within Love"</b>

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.800
Yontani?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.390
He seems kinda shady.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.120
W-Wait, you mean...

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:07.930
<b>The Butterfly of the Night</b>

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.930
The author of the current bestseller, 
<i>The Butterfly of the Night</i>?

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.850
Exactly.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.180
Y-You're kidding!

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:21.100
<b>The Butterfly of the Night (Vol 1)
Yontani Abeyuki</b>

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:21.100
<b>The Butterfly of the Night (Vol 2)
Yontani Abeyuki</b>

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.380
I had no idea the author 
of such a renowned work

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.960
was such a pervy old geezer!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.160
Is he famous?

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.110
You haven't heard of him?!

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:25.740
He wrote the crazy popular period romance 
epic, <i>The Butterfly of the Night</i>!

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:27.690
To Be Reprinted!!

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:31.400
The huge bestseller, now
 in stores nationwide!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:27.690
<b>Over 2,000,000 
copies sold!</b>

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:31.400
<b>Movie Adaptation 
Announced!!</b>

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.690
<b>Yontani Abeyuki 
The Butterfly of the Night 
Part 1 and 2</b>

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.460
The series isn't complete yet,

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:32.120
but his depiction of the 
Meiji era is so realistic.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.170
And above all, the anguish 
of unrealized love...

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:38.730
<i>The Butterfly of the Night</i> is not my work!

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:39.380
Huh?

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:44.820
To be precise, it's the 
work of the <i>other</i> me.

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:46.640
What do you mean?

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.760
<b>Nanagase Inn</b>

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:49.760
I've been staying at this 
inn for six months,

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:55.770
<b>Nanagase Inn</b>

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:55.770
and when night falls, I always 
find myself writing manuscripts.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:59.020
I didn't think anything of it at first.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:03.950
Authors experience memory loss in 
the face of deadlines all the time.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.170
But with each day, more and 
more pages were finished.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:09.600
They were all situations I'd 
never even thought about

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.450
and stories I'd never heard before.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:19.960
<b>The Butterfly of the Night</b>

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.980
And the finished product was 
<i>The Butterfly of the Night</i>.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.550
I'm certain of it now...

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:25.250
I must be possessed by a ghost.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.530
Not a chance!

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.840
Say what?!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.200
Are you saying you don't believe me?!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:33.750
I don't see any signs of possession.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.000
Well, I mean...

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:41.650
He's writing.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:46.870
I can't believe he ate this much food.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.160
That was Yontani-sensei's idea.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:53.160
Oh? I guess he has his good side.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:56.540
I'm sleepy after eating so much.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:06:00.300
I'll be sleeping next door. 
Wake me if anything happens.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:03.550
I'll go return these trays.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:05.190
Want some help?

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:06.590
That's okay.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.600
I'll be right back. Just keep
 an eye on him, okay?

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:17.240
<i>What if Yontani-san really is possessed?</i>

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.740
<i>There's a bound spirit in here.</i>

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.170
Thank you for the meal.

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.650
Oh, thanks for bringing these.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.210
Goodnight, then.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:37.370
Aw, the girl isn't here today.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.940
I'm getting sleepy...

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.230
<i>Nana-chan's in danger!</i>

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.650
Is something wrong?

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:10.780
<i>He's gone.</i>

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.740
<i>That must mean...</i>

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.580
<i>If you really are Nana-chan...</i>

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.410
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.770
Magic Binding Spell!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.090
You're a medium?!

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.350
The talisman misfired?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.090
That's...

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.510
I knew it!

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.070
I think it's a bound spirit.

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:41.440
My guess is that he 
disguised himself as you.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.370
Say what?!

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:47.630
F-Forgive me!

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.590
Wait, is he really a spirit?

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:53.240
Muhyo-san, wake up!

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:54.890
Nana-chan!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.800
What's going on here?

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.660
Muhyo-san won't wake up!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.660
I'm so glad she's safe.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:08.500
I'm so grateful for this opportunity.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.290
Please forgive me for my rudeness earlier.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:14.510
I thought if I startled her, she'd leave...

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.830
<i>Spirits that talk a lot 
are especially dangerous.</i>

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:19.190
And to you, Yontani-dono,
 I don't know what to say...

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:20.840
<i>But if he has enough memories 
to write whole novels...</i>

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.020
<i>Just who...</i>

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.020
Enough! Just tell me your name!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.580
You're being rude!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.150
Oh, forgive me.

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:32.150
My name is Hirata Zansetsu.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:44.150
<b>The Tale of Hirata Zansetsu</b>

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.640
I'm an author born in the Meiji era,

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:40.470
but I never did anything but chat with 
my friends and goof off every day.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.160
I was just a third-rate author.

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:46.780
Before I could even write 
anything worthwhile,

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:51.170
I was stricken by tuberculosis, 
which was untreatable at the time.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.170
<b>Tuberculosis</b>

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:54.690
I went looking for hot springs that 
were said to lengthen one's life span,

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:55.180
<b>Nanagase Hot Springs</b>

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:58.510
and I ended up in Nanagase 
to find relief in the baths.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:09:00.380
<b>Hot Spring Health Resort</b>

00:08:55.180 --> 00:09:00.380
<b>Nanagase Hot Springs 
Meiji era</b>

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:03.750
I proclaimed myself an author,

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.300
but had never done anything, 
and I cursed myself for it.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.970
I even thought of ending my own life.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:12.540
"I have nothing."

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:17.450
And then, she saved me.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:20.570
<b>Yuri</b>

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:19.310
Her name was Yuri.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.860
It was terminal love at 
a hot spring health resort.

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:27.870
She had tuberculosis, too.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:31.730
Our love was brief, but it burned hot...

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.470
and was so fleeting.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:45.170
Lost in grief after Yuri's passing,

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:51.740
I wanted desperately to preserve our 
beautiful memories for future generations.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.030
And that obsession...

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:01.780
was what pushed me to write.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.820
<b>The Butterfly of the Night</b>

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:02.870
But...

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.700
Then you died, right?!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:12.310
That whole story is in 
<i>The Butterfly of the Night</i>!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.700
<b>The Butterfly of the Night</b> (Vol 1)
Yontani Abeyuki

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:16.560
So this series is autobiographical?

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.760
As you can imagine,

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:22.240
my strength finally ran out.

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:25.910
But I couldn't let myself die yet,

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:29.030
so I remained bound to this inn,

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:35.010
where I searched for the perfect author to 
finish <i>The Butterfly of the Night</i> for me.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.510
<b>Nanagase</b>

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:40.370
Time flowed on around me...

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.570
<b>Nanagase</b>

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.270
<b>Nanagase</b>

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:44.920
until Yontani-dono appeared.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.570
He was old...

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:51.980
It's no use! No use!

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:56.000
But the strong desire pouring 
from within him drew me to him.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.910
I knew he would understand me.

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:03.020
To avoid the suspicion of those in the inn,

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:05.630
I disguised myself as him at night

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.240
and just kept writing.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:15.600
I can't begin to imagine how rude 
my behavior must have been to you,

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:16.670
but...

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.770
That is just how desperately 
I wanted my story written!

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:23.820
Please, let me keep writing!

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:25.830
It's almost finished!

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:29.520
<i>I see.</i>

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.890
<i>The strength of Zansetsu-san's feelings 
must have caused those memories to...</i>

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:36.340
Let me just say one thing.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:39.090
This series...

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.310
isn't sexy enough.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:49.010
<b>Hell Train</b>

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:49.010
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:55.020
<b>Ferry Ride Across the Styx</b>

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.020
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.030
Well, go on and peep—

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.820
I mean, observe!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.980
B-But that's so obscene...

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:04.950
Take a good look, or I won't 
let you write anything!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.030
P-Please, no!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:12.290
<i>Just deal with it! It's for 
the sake of a masterpiece!</i>

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.930
Okay, now take off your towel!

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:22.550
That's not funny!

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:24.200
H-How can this be?

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.940
Come on, don't be like that! Let us see!

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.640
Feelings are powerful things.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:27.430
No! I refuse!

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.980
What have you got to lose?!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.550
They're keeping him going even 
though he's become a spirit.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:33.000
Feelings are no more than feelings.

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:36.290
Muhyo, when did you get here?

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.820
And a crime is a crime.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:41.150
According to Magical Law Article 882,

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:47.570
for "Prolonged Unsolicited Residence"
 and "Unsolicited Facial Transcription"...

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:49.580
Muhyo, wait!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.640
Zansetsu-san hasn't finished his book yet!

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:55.080
And everyone's having a good time...

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:58.210
I think you're mistaken about something.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:02.390
You need to get rid of that soft 
spot you have for spirits.

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:04.870
<b>Sentence: Owl of No Return</b>

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:06.800
I sentence you to "Owl of No Return"!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.040
What is that?!

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:24.950
Did that come from... Muhyo-san?!

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:32.660
I commend you for remaining lucid in 
this world as long as you have.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:38.170
But what you've done could cause 
someone to lose their life.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.670
Though it was only an attempt, 
it's still a grave crime.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:45.170
So grave that I should really 
send you to Hell right now.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.410
Please, no!

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.930
Hey, are you okay?

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.680
N-No!

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:58.940
H-Hey!

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:01.570
Nana-chan!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.310
<b>Women's Bath</b>

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:09.820
Nana-chan!

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:13.950
Let me write my book!

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:17.580
Otherwise, I'll kill her!

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:21.350
That's quite the transformation.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.840
Zansetsu...

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.840
All of you, leave this inn at once!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:32.470
Otherwise, this girl will be 
imprisoned here along with me!

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.880
Muhyo-san! Roji!

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.270
What should we do, Muhyo?!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:42.710
He's a bound spirit. 
He can't leave this inn.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.100
I'll take my time finding him...

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.680
and punish him with this.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.570
It's smaller now!

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:58.750
This is how you keep a messenger of Hell 
in this world once it's been summoned.

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:03.870
Does he have to go to Hell right away?

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.250
You bet he does.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:08.460
Unsolicited Facial Transcription 
takes over another's life,

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:11.300
ultimately taking it from them for good.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:15.180
It can turn into the serious crime 
of "Becoming Someone Else."

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:21.050
<b>Women's Bath</b>

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.110
Yontani-sensei, wait!

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:21.060
It's dangerous to go on your own!

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:26.570
Zansetsu! Where are you, Zansetsu?!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.690
Where are you?!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.700
Damn it!

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:32.950
<i>What can I do?</i>

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:35.750
<i>If I don't do something, 
</i>The Butterfly of the Night<i> will...</i>

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.240
<i>His feelings will...</i>

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:39.880
Ow!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.490
Let go of the girl...

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:45.910
and get out of here, now!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.510
Right. Now start a new 
paragraph and continue.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:55.660
Hey, Zansetsu! If you're 
in here, you have to—

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:02.010
Oh, Yontani-dono, you're here.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.200
Wh-What are you saying?

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.730
What happened to you?

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:10.700
The Butterfly of the Night

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.690
It's the opening of <i>The Butterfly 
of the Night</i>'s last book.

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.970
I'm sorry my writing is so hard to read.

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:16.650
Why did you write this?

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:18.450
Weren't you imprisoned here?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.000
That's what I thought, too, but that wasn't it.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:26.720
It's just that Zansetsu-san can't 
write anymore in this form.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.710
I was a bit rough with her...

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:33.220
But she wrote my words down for me.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:38.220
If I didn't at least finish 
a manuscript of the opening,

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:41.820
I'd never be able to get 
you to write the rest.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:51.110
These faces are all the people 
I've mimicked over the years.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:55.670
I have indeed committed 
the grave crime of taking

00:16:55.670 --> 00:17:00.120
all these people's lives from them.

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:04.790
I humbly accept that I'm bound for Hell.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.630
But first...

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:11.130
I want you to promise that you'll write
the rest of <i>The Butterfly of the Night</i>.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:17.380
The Butterfly of the Night

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.390
You fool.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.390
You know I can't write it.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:24.750
You call me a peeping tom and a pervert,

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:29.460
but I've never had a true 
relationship with a woman.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:32.400
So I can't write romance stories.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:35.970
And in the six months 
since I came to this inn,

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:38.410
I haven't written a single manuscript.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:41.850
In fact, I haven't written 
one in five years.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:46.090
The world has already forgotten about me,

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:50.330
and even my publisher has cut 
me loose, leaving me alone...

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:54.910
The Butterfly of the Night

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:54.920
so I was just clinging to 
<i>The Butterfly of the Night</i>.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:58.690
<i>The story wrote itself night after night,</i>

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:02.470
<i>and I just let it, claiming it as my own.</i>

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.170
To Be Reprinted!!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.170
The huge bestseller,
 now in stores nationwide!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.380
Then it became a huge hit,

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:05.170
<b>Movie Adaptation 
Announced!!</b>

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:05.170
<b>Over 2,000,000 copies sold!</b>

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.170
<b>Yontani Abeyuki 
The Butterfly of the Night 
Part 1 and 2</b>

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.210
Yontani Abeyuki Autograph Booth

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.230
and I made a fortune.

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:10.420
That's when I finally 
started to feel guilty for

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.120
getting famous off of someone else's work,

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.170
and I felt so anxious...

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:18.380
So, before I started writing the final book,

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.120
<b>We Offer Consultations for Those Troubled by Spirits
The Muhyo Bureau of Supernatural Investigation 
</b>Advertisement by: <b>Kusano Jiro</b>

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:22.270
I called a magical lawyer.

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:31.250
You cherished those feelings of 
yours for all these long years,

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.830
and I tried to take them from you!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:41.610
I'm not worthy of writing the rest of it!

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:51.410
I knew that my awareness 
would not last much longer.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:58.780
I had already made up my mind that 
I wanted you to write the last book.

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.360
And you know...

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:05.790
you are the only one who can write it.

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:09.820
The long years of loneliness 
and guilt you felt

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:13.870
made you experience
 the same feelings I had.

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:16.390
That's how I knew you could do it.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:22.260
That was how I felt as I watched you.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:26.400
You have no idea how happy I was

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:30.560
to meet you...

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:36.940
No!

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.780
Finished saying goodbye?

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.540
Stop! Why does Zansetsu-san 
have to go to Hell?!

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.410
Nana-chan, I know how you 
feel, but calm down!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.810
This is for the best.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:55.540
Right, medium?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.130
This is... right...

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:03.030
Wait, Zansetsu! Wait, I said!

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:08.970
Hey! Zansetsu!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.580
How does this sound for the last line?!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.060
"Happiness is...

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:20.570
as fragile and fleeting as a butterfly 
in the night, and that is why...

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.700
it becomes the one and only

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:28.780
irreplaceable happiness in this world!"

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:32.430
That sounds wonderful.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.460
Muhyo Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:48.470
Roji-kun! Muhyo-san!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.220
He's on TV!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:57.230
<b>We Ask Yontani</b>

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:57.230
<b>The Butterfly of the Night</b>

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.220
He looks as cocky as ever.

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.800
<i>Ah, I see.</i>

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:57.230
<i>We're all looking forward to the last 
book of </i>The Butterfly of the Night<i>.</i>

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.000
Can you tell us the theme of this book?

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:03.000
The theme, eh?

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.990
But you know...

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.610
<i>You sure are sexy!</i>

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.980
<b>We Ask Yontani</b>

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.980
<b>The Butterfly of the Night</b>

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:08.660
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.670
<i>Wanna go to a hot spring with me?</i>

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:11.210
Is the last book going to be okay?

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:11.750
<i>Excuse me, Sensei!</i>

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:16.390
Ah, forgive me. Anyway, the theme is...

00:21:18.930 --> 00:21:22.850
"the joy of being alive," I'd say.

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:24.620
<b>The Butterfly of the Night 
Conclusion</b>

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:56.180
<b>Let's learn about magical law!</b>

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:57.720
<b>Incoming Call</b>

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:00.430
<b>Call in Progress</b>

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:00.440
Hello? What's up?

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:04.070
Right now? I'm actually 
at a hot spring inn...

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:07.890
Oh, listen to this! I met Yontani Abeyuki!

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:10.210
What? You don't know him?

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:12.110
I see...

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:14.450
Tomorrow?

00:23:14.820 --> 00:23:16.330
The bowling alley?

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.240
Coupons? Opening day?

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:21.960
Jeez, who do you think I am?

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:23.960
There'll be hot guys there?

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:25.760
No, it's fine!

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:29.330
Sorry, sorry! Forget about 
it! It's nothing about you.

00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:29.960
<b>"The Butterfly of the Night"
 Conclusion Release Party     Yontani</b>

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:35.310
Come on, you're late, Riko and Muhyo!

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:38.680
Huh? Roji-san, the assistant?

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:41.900
That's right. This is...

00:23:42.860 --> 00:23:46.940
Next time on <i>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau 
of Supernatural Investigation</i>,

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:48.480
Article 7:

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:50.020
"Magic Prison."

